{"id":"14de23f863b8ccccd4c60d40f5a83012043e29a4","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1256911","title":"[开源] 🤳在我的世界风格个人网站，也能拍拍拍！","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"terry728","excerpt":"程序员 - @terry728 - ![拍照模式]( https://github.com/terryHu7/homecraft/releases/download/v0.2.0/photo-studio-default.webp)","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div>\n    \n    <div><p><a href=\"/member/terry728\"><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/b577f2697be0b4f9618265bd46b14abc?s=73&d=retro\" alt=\"terry728\" data-uid=\"719308\"></a></p>\n    <div><p><a href=\"/\">V2EX</a> <span>&#160;›&#160;</span> <a href=\"/go/programmer\">程序员</a></p></div>\n    \n    <h2>[开源] 🤳在我的世界风格个人网站，也能拍拍拍！</h2>\n     &#160; <p><small><a href=\"/member/terry728\">terry728</a> · <span title=\"2026-11-13 18:00:46 +08:00\">19h 58m ago</span> · 761 views</small>\n    </p></div>\n    \n    \n    \n    <div><p><img alt=\"拍照模式\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://github.com/terryHu7/homecraft/releases/download/v0.2.0/photo-studio-default.webp\"></p>\n<p><img alt=\"自拍模式\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://github.com/terryHu7/homecraft/releases/download/v0.2.0/photo-studio-selfie.webp\"></p>\n<p>受 GTA ，看门狗 2 ，地平线等游戏启发，新增了拍照/自拍功能。</p>\n<p>注意这不是游戏！是我的世界风格的 3D 个人网站。</p>\n<p>或者与其说是个人网站，更像是元宇宙，通过传说门还能可以和朋友们互通有无。</p>\n<p>如果你也看腻了传统个人网站，不如看看这个开源项目👉</p>\n<p>🔗 <a href=\"https://github.com/terryHu7/homecraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/terryHu7/homecraft</a> </p>\n<p>🔗 <a href=\"https://terryhu.cn\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://terryhu.cn</a> </p>\n<p>手机端还专门做了适配，效果如下：\n<img alt=\"selfie\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/terryHu7/homecraft@img-photo-studio-mobile/docs/images/photo-studio-mobile-shot-2026-11-13.jpg\"></p>\n</div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n</div></DIV>","content_text":"V2EX › 程序员 [开源] 🤳在我的世界风格个人网站，也能拍拍拍！ terry728 · 19h 58m ago · 761 views 受 GTA ，看门狗 2 ，地平线等游戏启发，新增了拍照/自拍功能。 注意这不是游戏！是我的世界风格的 3D 个人网站。 或者与其说是个人网站，更像是元宇宙，通过传说门还能可以和朋友们互通有无。 如果你也看腻了传统个人网站，不如看看这个开源项目👉 🔗 https://github.com/terryHu7/homecraft 🔗 https://terryhu.cn 手机端还专门做了适配，效果如下：","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T05:59:22.690Z","ok":true}